## ObjectType: offering for sale business process

Source label: offering for sale business process. Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/SellingBusinessProcess`. Source definition: business process wherein a product or commercial service is offered by an agent (seller) for another agent (buyer) to acquire ownership via a financial instrument

